The Atelier platform provides API-type interfaces, which will enable integration with the client's existing infrastructure and tools. Additionally, our platform supports single sign-on (SSO) through SAML and OIDC, as well as user directories like LDAP and Entra ID, to ensure secure access and authentication.

Overall, our proposed architecture leverages the strengths of our Atelier platform, integrating it with the client's existing tools and infrastructure while ensuring performance, security, and data sovereignty.
